      "message_parsed": "Для тех, у кого стоит мультитрекер:<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\">    $topics = DB()-&gt;fetch_rowset(&quot;\n        SELECT t.topic_title, t.topic_id, tp.post_text\n        FROM &quot;. BB_TOPICS .&quot; t\n        LEFT JOIN &quot;. BB_FORUMS .&quot; f ON (t.forum_id = f.forum_id)\n        LEFT JOIN &quot;. BB_POSTS_TEXT .&quot; tp ON (tp.post_id = t.topic_first_post_id)\n        LEFT JOIN &quot;. BB_BT_TORRENTS .&quot; tor ON (t.topic_id = tor.topic_id)\n        LEFT JOIN &quot;. BB_BT_TRACKER_SNAP .&quot; sn ON (t.topic_id = sn.topic_id)\n        WHERE t.topic_dl_type = 1\n        $forum_in\n        ORDER BY (tor.tor_seeders + IFNULL(sn.seeders, 0)) DESC\n        LIMIT 50\n    &quot;);</pre> <br />\nДля тех, у кого нет мультитрекера (не тестил, лень):<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\">    $topics = DB()-&gt;fetch_rowset(&quot;\n        SELECT t.topic_title, t.topic_id, tp.post_text\n        FROM &quot;. BB_TOPICS .&quot; t\n        LEFT JOIN &quot;. BB_FORUMS .&quot; f ON (t.forum_id = f.forum_id)\n        LEFT JOIN &quot;. BB_POSTS_TEXT .&quot; tp ON (tp.post_id = t.topic_first_post_id)\n        LEFT JOIN &quot;. BB_BT_TRACKER_SNAP .&quot; sn ON (t.topic_id = sn.topic_id)\n        WHERE t.topic_dl_type = 1\n        $forum_in\n        ORDER BY sn.seeders DESC\n        LIMIT 50\n    &quot;);</pre>",
